    const-string v129, "Editor\'s note: each individual news ticker message is called a \"news message\", while the ticker as a whole is referred to as the \"news ticker\". So you \"see news messages on the news ticker\" and you wouldn\'t say \"this ticker\" but rather \"this news message\"."

