    const-string v131, "Hi, I\'m FPS pro player. My accuracy is almost 90%. One day, my friend tell me to play Antimatter Dimensions. My friend is so excited to play. So I download and play it. Well, at start, it look normal. I assume Antimatter is Money. When I buy 1st Dimension, something is weird. My Antimatter is growing. Even the Dimension is growing. But I don\'t care. Then I buy 2nd and 3rd Dimension. Antimatter growing very crazy. I got 1 Qa Antimatter and I don\'t know what is Qa. In other FPS games, the most possible money amount 100 Thousand. When I reach 20 4th Dimensions, I click \"Reset the game for new Dimension\" and then it reset. That\'s most infuriating thing. I reported to Dev and he said, \"This is an Incremental Idle game\". I shocked about that and I\'m so mad with this game. It don\'t train my accuracy, it waste my time, and decrease my skill to play FPS. I hate this game."

