    const-string v131, "May I please have a moment of your time. I\'m on a quest, one that has lasted me over a year. All I am looking for is the original \"figured out why city boys dont drive lifted trucks very much\" aka \"swaos\" video. I have searched high and low, but to no avail. If you know where I can find this video, please message me on Discord at BoomerThor. Thank you for your time."

