    const-string v14, "\"Oh... Alright thanks for the info! Well apparently the developers have opened the suggestions channel to a couple of lucky people a couple of days ago and we\'re expecting the first suggestions to come out within a few min- Oh it\'s there it\'s there! Point the camera at the screen, quickly!\"<end>"

