    const-string v12, "Breaking News: <gold>\"It\'s been months now since the channel for suggesting new messages in the ticker has been deleted and new fans of the game are still mad about it. We\'re here at the Antimatter Dimensions Development HQ to see how and what these protesters are doing. Let\'s ask this young lad right here.\"     \"Who are you and why are you here right now?\"<end> <red>\"Hello uhh, my name is Timmy and I play this game 25 hours a day because I uh- love it so much and I am really mad that we can\'t submit news tick-\"<end> <gold>\"You mean news messages?\"<end> <red>\"What?\"<end> <gold>\"Yeah uhh, nevermind let\'s ask anoth- Oh what\'s that Mike?\""

