    const-string v12, "<gold>\"Oh... Well that\'s... Interesting to say the least. Well now we know that the developers are taking inspiration from players aga- Wait what\'s that again Mike? The developers discontinued the entire thing? Oh... Okay that\'s also interes-\"<end> <green>\"Uhh, sir?\"<end> <gold>\"Yeah?\"<end> <green>\"The Antimatter Cannons seems to be charging, and they\'re aiming directly at us.\"<end> <gold>\"Well then, now is probably a good time to end this. Well this is your reporter, Joey Chad, SIGNING OU-\"<end>"

