    const-string v14, "Snorting crushed up Time Shards is slowly turning into a fad challenge amongst the most bored of people. It\'s said that the high it gives makes them experience as if the world itself is speeding up around you, which is why it\'s been called The <purple>Timelapse Challenge<end>. "

