    const-string v133, "You have reached the automated Antimatter Dimensions support tickerline. If you are experiencing a bug in the game try closing and reopening the app, if that doesn\'t work reply 1 for web, 2 for mobile. If you need advice press 3, if you need to max all press M. To support the developers press $, to access the FAQ press 5, to fix a broken save press 6, to get an invite to the discord server press 7, to see change log press 8. Press 10 to repeat."

