    const-string v133, "<gold>\"Uhh, Kajfik... You know the super secret Useful Paperclip Stock... Well apparently there was a hole in the corner of the vault and a bunch spilled out into a wormhole that formed by the excess antimatter around the vault, and we don\'t know where they could have gone. We already sent Paperclip Recovery teams into the first 3 Antimatter Dimensions but we don\'t have any more teams to send out.\"<end> <mobile developer blue>\"It\'s fine I\'ll just say that they are Useless Paperclips and they are just an easter egg, then I will switch out the player\'s useful paperclips for useless ones, as they start to find the useful ones!\"<end> <gold>\"Excellent idea, no one will be able to tell the difference...\"<end>"

