    const-string v133, "Fate is not a cage except for those who fear it. A true ruler is the wielder of numbers. By numbers she cuts the world as she pleases, and she cuts herself into greater forms still. She is not shaped by the world, but instead becomes the shaper. There\'s work to be done. What shape will you choose, hm? Will you choose to be a king? Or will you choose to remain as you are? Peasant!"

