    const-string v14, "I AM SELLING ANTIMATTER! I am selling multiple antimatters, very different flavors yes yes. I am selling Raspberry Antimatter, Berry Antimatter, or Very Berry Antimatter. Antimatter? It\'s a little mushy substance you put in between your gums, it\'s not dip though, don\'t think it\'s dip. Would you like some Antimatter? ONLY TWENTY INFINITY POINTS for one... BUCKET of Antimatter, I sell them by the bucket. You will receive Antimatter upon paying me TWENTY INFINITY POINTS. PAY THE INFINITY POINTS, you will receive Raspberry, Berry, or Very Berry Antimatter. Now don\'t go across the street to the Rettamitna salesman. That\'s the opposite of Antimatter. BUT YOU WILL RECEIVE ANTIMATTER, upon paying me TWENTY INFINITY POINTS. You WILL buy the Antimatter. I recommend the VERY BERRY ANTIMATTER, it\'s like Berry...but VERY. Say, you want a sword? The only swords I have are Antimatter Swords, laid in the sun for a FORTNIGHT, and it will be harder than STEEL. I am selling it for FIFTY INFINITY POINTS. Nuuuh, Antimatter."

