    const-string v133, "Did you ever hear the tragedy of slabdrill the contributor? I thought not. It\'s not a story the Hevipelle would tell you. It\'s a 9th Dimension legend. Slabdrill was a dark lord of the 9th Dimension, so powerful and so wise he could use Github to push commits without anyone\'s permission. He had such a knowledge of the github repo that he could even create a new branch with the implementation of 9th Dimensions. The dark side of developing is a pathway to many ideas some consider to be unnatural. He became so powerful... the only thing he was afraid of was losing his Github permissions, which eventually, of course, he did. Unfortunately, he taught everyone in discord about that new update, then he was killed when Hevipelle returned. It\'s ironic he could save pull requests from death, but not himself."

