    const-string v133, "We\'ve made a deal with multiple different fast food corporations - McRonalds, KFP, Zchnits, Chromatic Chicekn, Pizza the Hutt, the lot of them. And using the latest in technology, pioneered by Sonny and kept hidden for over 15 years, you can now order food in-game as well as delivery, without leaving your seat!* The current commands are /burger, /fried, /schnitzel, /chicken and /pizzza (changed for copyright reasons), corresponding to the fast food chains above respectively. Each of these commands will take you to an in-game order form which will allow you to enter your details, and get your chosen indulgence delivered straight to your house!* In addition, the M key is automatically pressed while you are on this page, and we only take a small surcharge, less than what your credit card company takes, for the privledges of in-game ordering! Stay tuned for when we work how out to expand on this functionality, and start letting you do your banking (complete with dramatised compound interest because that\'s all incremental games are) from your greasy, fast-food-ridden gaming chair!            *participating restaurants only. This offer expires in 5 hours. Delivery surcharges will apply, don\'t you dare try to convince us otherwise."

