    const-string v133, "Attention residents of zone 4 [commonly referred to as \'dark zone\'], sector \u03f0, (01,05). Do not leave your places of residence. I repeat, do not leave your places of residence. Do not go outside. Earthology\'s finest meteorological supercomputers, as well as many witches, are consistently claiming a \'generally weird vibe\' tomorrow and we quite frankly don\'t want to find out what that means."

