    const-string v133, "Technological convergence is the concept that all technologies will converge into a single technology. It is a commonly expressed idea since the dawn of the Information Age, and can be seen in many places and devices such as smartphones, or the internet. Antimatter Dimensions is an example of technological convergence, specifically within media. Using a genius idea called \'not caring\' mixed in with the innovative solution of \'blind luck\', it merges together a subpar game, and a subpar news ticker, to create a mediocre experience that despite being mostly a game, occasionally acts as a news source slightly above the Matter Dimensions Newsticker. Truly, an achievement for all businesses to aspire to strive towards, and hopefully actually beat."

