    const-string v133, "A speedrunner starts a new save. They are greeted by a guardian of speedrunners. The guardian asks the speedrunner why he shall be worthy of attempting another speedrun. The speedrunner answered, \"I have mastered the inner workings of the game, and I know what to do to optimize my runs best.\" The guardian said, \"Those who have mastered the inner workings of the game are not always capable of producing fast runs.\" to which the speedrunner says, \"Then you must know of every single upgrade, with their formulas and softcaps. You must know of every single little exploit, every bug.\""

