    const-string v14, "<mobile developer blue>Hey, Hevi.<end> Sup, Kaj. What\'s up? <mobile developer blue>I want to talk about the one who made it to the very end. Who completed all of our tasks.<end> AD player? <mobile developer blue>Yes. They did an awesome job.<end> I agree. They managed to get an Infinity, then an Eternity, and it was... Ummm... <mobile developer blue>Shocking?<end> No. <mobile developer blue>Mentionable?<end> Partially yes, but... <mobile developer blue>Hmmm... Wonderful?<end> Exactly. It was wonderful. Not many people get to an Eternity. <mobile developer blue>(and not even everyone gets to Infinity)<end> Yes. But they managed to get to Time Dilation, AND, get this, e4000 EP. <mobile developer blue>Wow. Was that hard for them?<end> Well, I did not look at their stats. But getting to Time Dilation is an adventure in itself, so yes, I presume it was hard. <mobile developer blue>What are we going to do?<end> Say goodbye to them. They did an excellent job and deserve some rest after all this work. <mobile developer blue>I agree, Hevi. Goodbye, AD player. We will remember you fondly.<end> Goodbye, AD player. In peace, may you leave this dimension. In love, may you find the next. Safe passage on your travels, until our final journey to the Celestials. May we meet again."

