    const-string v158, "Congratulations. You\'ve made it. Welcome to Avaritia, the land of numbers and greed. It\'s all over. All those dimensions you have sacrificed, all those worlds you have destroyed in Big Crunches and Challenges, all of those automata you have forced to slave away to aid in your machinations, all that Replicanti you have bent to your will in their overpopulated, decrepit reality... None of it matters now. All that matters is that big number displaying Antimatter, and those dimensions, those dominions you have brought under your reign. It is because of you, all of your hard work, that that number is as big as it has become. Don\'t worry -- there is still plenty for us to do. Come now; let us continue."

