    move-object/16 v1150, v130

    move-object/16 v1147, v130

    const-string v130, "\"It\'s never too late to bring humanity back from extinction. Some DNA, a Petri Dish, the back of a mouse and some sort of giant robot-computer and even the human race can be saved! We never have to worry about looking after the environment again! Do your darnedest Helios, you heavenly ball of burning gas, we will outlive you and rule the universe for eternity!\" - An Ode to \'Humanity\' - last recorded transmission from now missing inhabited Exoplanet, presumed destroyed after premature supernova of orbited star."

