    move-object/16 v1152, v130

    move-object/16 v1149, v130

    const-string v130, "In the vast expanse of the universe, there are an infinite number of dimensions. Some are larger than others, but all of them exist. One of these dimensions is antimatter, and in it, there are an infinite number of universes. Some of these universes are similar to our own, while others are completely different. In one of these universes, a scientist named John was working on a project that could change the course of history. He was close to completing it, but he was attacked by a group of rebels who did not believe in his project. John was able to defeat them, but he was injured in the process. He was taken to a hospital in our universe, and he was able to finish his project. The result of his work was the creation of Morbius."

