    move-object/16 v1165, v130

    move-object/16 v1162, v130

    const-string v130, "So, you downloaded this game and thought: \"Huh this is pretty cool.\" Then you read that and thought: \"Yeah, it is pretty cool.\" Then you thought: \"Wait... did the news ticker just plant a thought in my head, no wait a second, I\'m reading the news ticker, how can it be inside my head?\" But then you kept reading and wondered to yourself: \"No, that\'s not possible, what\'s going on?\" The news ticker can\'t possibly know what I\'m thinking I\'m my own person, I think for myself, my thoughts are mine and no-one else\'s. But then you realised the news ticker isn\'t using quotations anymore, and hasn\'t for a sentence or two. You see you were already part of the news ticker from the beginning this is just your subconscious self trying to get your attention and pull you back to reality. Trouble is: reality is often much further than we think..."

