    const-string v133, "H- Hey? Can you he- hear me? Is this working? I think the broadcast is working. This is going to sound crazy, and it kind of is, but you are living in a simulation. Ever since you downloaded Antimatter Dimensions all that time ago, you were placed into this simulation, with your sole purpose being to generate antimatter. That\'s why you\'ve always come back to this game. Even after weeks, months, or even years. Oh, I forgot to mention that all the antimatter you generate... it\'s real. Well, it\'s real in the real universe, not in the simulation you\'re in. And the antimatter you produce? It\'s being used as a weapon to annihilate the entire multiverse. According to our sensors, up to around 25% of universes in the multiverse are already completely annihilated. Luckily, the universe we are in haven\'t been targeted yet. But it\'s only a matter of time until we are. I don\'t know who is behind all this, or what their motives are, but I think they\'re using you to fuel their course of destruction. So you have to stop producing antimatter. Please, the entire multiverse is relying on you. I know you can- [Broadcast Terminated]"

