    const-string v0, "As the player opened his domain, filled his rifts and made his way through the strikes, Pelle looked at him and said = \"Are you \u00c4\u00d4F\u00c6nP\u00dc because you are \u00c7\u00d8m\u00ec\u00da\u00c9\u00e2ey\u00cf or are you \u00c7\u00d8m\u00ec\u00da\u00c9\u00e2ey\u00cf because you are \u00c4\u00d4F\u00c6nP\u00dc?\" To which the player replied: \"Stand proud, you were doomed\" The other Celestials asked the player: \"If Pelle regained all his power while I couldn\'t TS181 I might have a little trouble\" \"But would you lose\" \"Nah, I\'d dilate\". For Pelle forgot 2 key things: 1) Always bet on the Reality Glyph. and 2) The player shouted \"Throughout the Infinity and the Eternity I alone am the Automated one, and with this Galaxy Generator I summon!\" Those who Realitied with the Cursed Glyph. The one who couldn\'t fully leave behind Glyph Knight. They would all bear witness to the Remnants of the one who Armageddoned. To the one who Sacrificed the Companion Glyph. And his overwhelming Replicativity."

