    const-string v135, "It was the dawn of the third age of antimatterkind, ten years after the Newsticker-Quality war. The closure project was a dream given form. It\'s goal: to prevent another drop in quality by creating a place where shitposters and writers could work out their differences peacefully. It\'s a port of call, home away from home for antimatter and matter. Both wrapped in two million five hundred thousand tons of spinning metal... all alone in the night. It can be a dangerous place, but it\'s our last, best hope, for keeping the quality high. This is the story of the last of the suggestion channels. The year is 2258. The name of the place is #mobile-newsticker-suggestions."

