    const-string v13, "Study time! It\u2019s now a good time for our time study study time, where we study time studies. It\u2019s important to have a studying time studies time, because time study studies are needed for studying time and using time studies, which when at the right time, time can be studied for more time studies and gain more time dimensions. Henceforth on this study time each day, chosen due to convenient timing, will be timed 5 hours and designated for time study studies, exclusively studying time studies. It\u2019s time!"

