    const/16 v134, 0x0

    move-object/16 v1298, v134

    const-string v134, "Antimatter is really versatile. First, you can put antimatter in a high-energy reaction and suddenly become matter, or have matter convert into antimatter the same way, or have matter interact with antimatter and annihilate like, \"Haha, energy go boom!\" That\'s just way too cute! Also, photon! I really like when the photon has that high-frequency wave, and it\'s amazing how it can be both matter and antimatter. I really like how it can fulfil all those abstract needs. Being able to switch up the elements and isotopes of antimatter based on your need is a lot of fun too! It\'s actually so much fun! You have those light gas antimatter, or the heavy metal antimatter, everything! It\'s like you\'re enjoying all these kinds of antimatter at a buffet. I really want Hevipelle to try some on or Kajfik to try some on to replace their matter body. We really need antimatter to become a thing in reality and start selling it for AD2. Don\'t. You. Think. We. Really. Need. To. Officially. Give. Everyone. Antimatter?"

