    const-string v129, "To celebrate 5 years since AD released, we\u2019re announcing an AD legacy game! This revolutionary style of game, first used to make risk bearable and then used to make regicide bearable, permanently changes the way you play AD as you reset, and as such no AD playthrough is ever the same! Replace traditional dimensions with new altered dimensions that create metastatic distortions to unlock new upgrades! Galaxies rotate in and out to transform your progression! Switch the M hot key to B! Have replicanti iterate over other mechanics until you\u2019re only playing with replicanti! All of this and more, at the roll of an imaginary god - or rather our legacy edition! Comes with multiple stickers to stick onto your monitor, a custom spiked M key, and anti-epilepsy medication in case the CSS modifications get too wild. Estimated Price at Retail release is 2.5 angel kidneys, estimated playthrough time is 5 hours, spare monitor and metatarsals not included."

    move-object/16 v717, v129

