    const-string v1, "Antimatter, tickspeed, dimboosts, galaxies / Autobuyers, sacrifice, one e three oh eight. / IP upgrades, c8\u2019s easy, antitables, hold the m key / Antichallenged, Claustrophobic, crunches accelerate. / Column 4, DLC, boost Autobuyers with IP, / Big crunch is at max speed, time to BREAK INFINITY / Follow BUGO, Progress, IP\u2019s now in excess / Galaxies are one half stronger, IP breakdown goodbye / We didn\'t start the numbers. / It was always growing, / Antimatter\'s flowing. / We didn\'t start the numbers.  / We don\'t need to mention / There\'s no ninth dimension // New beginning, crunch on green, infinitely challenging / Autosac, rising IP, challenge 1 through 8. / Chance and rate, is this safe, Replicanti replicate, / RG timewall, other times await. / Eternity, one EP, big confusing study tree, / Milestones save you some clicks, Time dimensions give more ticks / Dims, pace, paths divide, multiply EP by five / Study more, EC4, Looking at the EC guide / We didn\'t start the numbers. / It was always growing, / Antimatter\'s flowing. / We didn\'t start the numbers. / We don\'t need to mention / There\'s no ninth dimension // One eight one, EC10, never need to crunch again, / Banking infs, dark and light, pop music, dilate time / Tachyons, TT wait, time dimensions 5 thru 8 / Tachyon galaxies, make a new Reality // Glyph of Power, Perk tree, Companion, R-Machines, / Amplifiers, Black hole, Red locks are a no-go / glyph sac, bulk ECs, auto-TT, rarity / Black hole 2 is too slow, coding with tomato / We didn\'t start the numbers. / It was always growing, / Antimatter\'s flowing. / We didn\'t start the numbers. / We don\'t need to mention / There\'s no ninth dimension // \u201cWe have been observing you,\u201d RM gain mult, glyph undo, / Perk shop unlock, pour machines up to the top. / Effarig, Music glyphs, saving glyph sets to a list / Factor weights, relic shards, EC10, discharge / Trampling on what I\u2019ve done, power from the Nameless Ones / Perfect glyphs, find the cracks, No 8th needed, tesseracts / We didn\'t start the numbers. / It was always growing, / Antimatter\'s flowing. / We didn\'t start the numbers. / We don\'t need to mention / There\'s no ninth dimension // V\u2019s vain, six aims, ST, reinstall the game / Ra reclaims their memories, timewalled here for centuries / alch resources slowly gained, DM, DE, Lai\u2019s chains, / 30 seconds, entropy, wait for singularities / Face the doomed reality, celebrate and dance so free, / Hollow/Void/Vaccum pay, Fill decay/collapse/disarray, IP, EP, Ivar K. / Dilation\u2019s inescapable, Drain the elementary/inevitable/irreversible / undermine Eternal/Deity/Monarch\u2019s powers, more to come in 5 hours / We didn\'t start the numbers. / It was always growing, / Antimatter\'s flowing. / We didn\'t start the numbers. / But when the  / Conflict\'s/Battle\'s/End is won / It will all be gone / and gone and gone / and gone and gone / and gone and gone / and gone and gone / and gone and gone / and gone and gone"

