    const-string v129, "I recently bought a <blue>Dimension<end> for my wife and I to use. It works well; it produces roughly 1 antimatter per second. I installed cameras on the inside of the <blue>Dimension<end> to discover and monitor the process in which it produces antimatter. It seems to convert energy directly into antimatter mass. Then, I proceeded to measure the interior of the <blue>Dimension<end> to compare it to the exterior. I discovered something peculiar...the inside was 1/12\" larger than the outside. I swear there\'s something more to this, but I don\'t know what it is..."

