    .line 1681
    const-string v14, "The 9th Antimatter Dimension exists. It is highly reactive and dangerous with anything, however we\'re pretty much sure it exists out there. Nobody knows where it is as of 3:26 PM, UTC+sqrt(-1), July 37th, 2094. Forty years ago, researcher \"Antimatter\" Dee Mansions picked up signals about 192 kilorealities off the coast of the celestial map that don\'t match anything we\'ve seen so far. We think it\'s anywhere from 50 to 110 gigarealities from the celestial map. Henry \"Hevi\" Pelle, the 7th president of the world, is trying to convince everybody it doesn\'t exist. But the search never stops. We\'re currently trying to find it. I am with 6.681 quadrillion other anti-people. The last warning sign was 1.26 megarealities ago. The signals are getting stronger. Remember this news ticker. Remember that the 9th AD exists. Never forget."

