    const-string v129, "Top tips for new parents! 1) never let your newborn play with antimatter. It\u2019s a choking hazard. 2) help them settle to sleep by mashing up an Infinity Point and rubbing it on their tummy. 3) babies love games! Try classics like peek-a-boost, or mix it up - you can\u2019t go wrong! 4) contrary to popular belief, applying Replicanti to a baby\u2019s gums does not help with teething pain, and in fact can make it worse. 5) just like EC11, parenting is a marathon, not a sprint. Take your time to create a routine that works for you, like starting the challenge _before_ giving them a bath, not after. Good luck!"

