    const-string v0, "What was I thinking with that last message? I mean really, another anti joke? The game\'s been out for 10 years at this point, I can\'t just flip with meaning of certain words in a popular, memed sentence like that! I mean anything I type here will probably reach at least 10000 people. Probably many more. What I write here will probably have more of a large scale impact than anything else I ever do. And I chose to waste that opportunity by writing the most generic thing possible? I suppose it doesn\'t really matter. This news ticker might not even make it in the game, and if it did, it\'s not like it would have an actual impact on the people it\'s shown to. There are thousands of other news tickers, many of them much better than any one I could make. But you know what? I think I can do better than this. I\'m going to give this one more try. Here we go:"

