    const-string v158, "I don\'t know why people set so many requirements on unlocking a news message. Anyone, regardless of where they are, should be able to read news freely. That is what the the news ticker is, something that everyone can enjoy. That\'s why this message can be viewed right from the start, no such thing as \"only appears when\". A constant reminder to liberate the news ticker, to make it truly accessible to all players without risk of being spoilered or being locked behind due to spoilers."

