    const-string v158, "Workers riot as new methods of production crash antimatter market; \"Used to be 40,000 antimatter a year would get you a house and let you raise a family, but with these new so called \'Antimatter Dimensions\' creating ridiculous quantities like 1.79e308, I\'d be hard pressed to give the stuff away!\" says one disgruntled employee. Fortunately, the riots met a swift end when the universe the workers were inhabiting was collapsed by excessive quantities of antimatter."

